{"title":"Algebra/Intermediate","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>An intermediate-level study of algebra involves familiarity with introductory topics to a high level and a multitude of new topics.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Topics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Topics</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Books</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Classes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Classes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Topics\">Topics</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Intermediate&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Topics\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Techniques for Solving Equations\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=System_of_equations\" title=\"System of equations\">System of equations</a>\n<ul><li>Substitution</li>\n<li>Elimination</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_number\" title=\"Complex number\">Complex number</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_equation\" title=\"Quadratic equation\">Quadratic equation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Conic_sections\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Conic sections\">Conic sections</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polynomials\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Polynomials\">Polynomials</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Division_Algorithm\" title=\"Division Algorithm\">Division Algorithm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Remainder_theorem\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Remainder theorem\">Remainder theorem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factor_Theorem\" title=\"Factor Theorem\">Factor Theorem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fundamental_Theorem_of_Algebra\" title=\"Fundamental Theorem of Algebra\">Fundamental Theorem of Algebra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rational_root_theorem\" title=\"Rational root theorem\">Rational root theorem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_conjugate_root_theorem\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Complex conjugate root theorem\">Complex conjugate root theorem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Elementary_symmetric_polynomial\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elementary symmetric polynomial\">Elementary symmetric polynomial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Newton%27s_Sums\" title=\"Newton&#39;s Sums\">Newton's Sums</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Descartes_Rule_of_Signs\" title=\"Descartes Rule of Signs\">Descartes Rule of Signs</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factoring\" title=\"Factoring\">Factoring</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simon%27s_Favorite_Factoring_Trick\" title=\"Simon&#39;s Favorite Factoring Trick\">Simon's Favorite Factoring Trick</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sum_and_difference_of_powers\" title=\"Sum and difference of powers\">Sum and difference of powers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sophie_Germain_Identity\" title=\"Sophie Germain Identity\">Sophie Germain Identity</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sequence\" title=\"Sequence\"> Sequences</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Series\" title=\"Series\">Series</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_sequence\" title=\"Arithmetic sequence\">Arithmetic sequence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometric_sequence\" title=\"Geometric sequence\">Geometric sequence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Harmonic_series\" title=\"Harmonic series\"> Harmonic sequence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetico-geometric_series\" title=\"Arithmetico-geometric series\"> Arithmetico-geometric sequence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Telescoping\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Telescoping\">Telescoping</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Recursion\" title=\"Recursion\">Recursion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Miscellanous <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Functions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Functions\">Functions</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\">Logarithm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Exponential_function\" title=\"Exponential function\">Exponential function</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Radical\" title=\"Radical\">Radical</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_value\" title=\"Absolute value\">Absolute value</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greatest_integer_function\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Greatest integer function\">Greatest integer function</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Least_integer_function\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Least integer function\">Least integer function</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Inequalities\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Inequalities\">Inequalities</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle_Inequality\" title=\"Triangle Inequality\">Triangle Inequality</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trivial_inequality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trivial inequality\">Trivial inequality</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_Mean-Geometric_Mean\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Arithmetic Mean-Geometric Mean\"> Arithmetic Mean-Geometric Mean Inequality</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cauchy-Schwarz_Inequality\" title=\"Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality\">Cauchy-Schwarz Inequality</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Functional_equations\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Functional equations\">Functional equations</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Intermediate&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books\">Books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Intermediate&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/aops-vol2%7C\">AoPS Volume 2</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/book/intermediate-algebra?srsltid=AfmBOooTTiKu7LfZxhl7K1YWe4K02Y3m38eG0xktSuzp5fCZRfoloNoW%7C\">AoPS Intermediate Algebra</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Classes\">Classes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Intermediate&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Classes\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>The <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/classdetails.php?course_id=4\">Intermediate Algebra Class</a> -- Intermediate Algebra Training.</li>\n<li>The <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Classes/AoPS_C_WOOT.php\">Worldwide Online Olympiad Training (WOOT) Program</a> -- Intermediate to Olympiad training in a variety of subjects, including algebra.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Intermediate&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Introduction\" title=\"Algebra/Introduction\"> Introductory Algebra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra/Olympiad\" title=\"Algebra/Olympiad\"> Olympiad Algebra</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018072543\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 55/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3493:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018072543 and revision id 290431. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}